        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.307,
            0.681,
            0.852,
            0.733
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Why is it more comfortable to wear white or light-colouredWhy is it more comfortable to wear white or light-coloured clothes during summers and dark-coloured clothes duringclothes during summers and dark-coloured clothes during winters?winters?"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.307,
            0.748,
            0.852,
            0.836
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Light-coloured clothes reflect most of the heat that falls onLight-coloured clothes reflect most of the heat that falls on them, and therefore, we feel more comfortable wearingthem, and therefore, we feel more comfortable wearing them during summers. Dark surfaces, on the other hand,them during summers. Dark surfaces, on the other hand, absorb more heat, and therefore, we feel more comfortableabsorb more heat, and therefore, we feel more comfortable with dark-coloured clothes during winters."
            }
          ]
        },
